        DATA.put("Saturn_H7",  "Partnership involves delay, karma, or serious long-term commitment orientation. Marriage tends to occur later than peers or involves significant age difference, background contrast, or relationship responsibility that deepens through patient mutual investment. Business partnerships succeed through clearly defined roles and disciplined long-term strategic planning.");
        DATA.put("Saturn_H8",  "Long life and capacity for sustained transformative psychological work. Inheritance matters may be delayed or involve karmic complexity. Deep, patient investigation of the hidden dimensions of existence — occult, psychological, or financial — can produce genuine mastery over many years of systematic dedicated study.");
        DATA.put("Saturn_H9",  "Philosophical seriousness, disciplined approach to spiritual practice, and the development of wisdom through direct experience of difficulty rather than received teaching. The father relationship may involve responsibility, distance, or a quality of karmic teaching. Philosophical convictions are hard-won and therefore genuinely durable.");
        DATA.put("Saturn_H10", "Exceptional placement for career achievement through patient sustained excellence. Success arrives later than peers but proves more substantial and durable. Government, institutional management, and any domain requiring methodical long-range planning suit this placement's patient ambition. Professional reputation builds steadily toward genuine authority.");
