        DATA.put("Saturn_H12", "Deep spiritual discipline, capacity for sustained meditative or contemplative practice, and a genuine calling toward solitude, retreat, or service in institutional or foreign environments. The dissolution of ego through Saturn's patient discipline rather than Jupiter's grace — a slower, more thorough process that arrives at deep, durable liberation.");
