        DATA.put("Rahu_H8",  "Deep fascination with hidden knowledge, occult sciences, and transformative experience. Inheritance matters may be complex. Psychological investigation and the exploration of consciousness through unconventional means engage this Rahu powerfully. The capacity for transformation through crisis is extraordinary when consciously worked rather than simply survived.");
