        DATA.put("Rahu_H12", "Deep connection to foreign lands, spiritual seeking, and the investigation of the most hidden dimensions of consciousness. Foreign travel, residence abroad, or sustained engagement with foreign spiritual traditions is likely. The dissolution of conventional identity through Rahu's amplifying lens can produce either genuine liberation or confusion about authentic direction.");
        // ── KETU ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
