        DATA.put("Ketu_H4",  "Emotional detachment from conventional home and family security, combined with deep spiritual connection to ancestral and collective roots. The inner home — the capacity for profound inner peace — is what genuinely matters and what is genuinely cultivated through this placement's distinctive inner orientation.");
