        DATA.put("Ketu_H6",  "Past-life experience with service, illness, and the confrontation of obstacles creating in this life either exceptional healing gifts, mystical approaches to health, or spiritual equanimity in the face of practical challenges. Immunity may be unusual in nature. Service motivated by genuine compassion rather than ego-driven helpfulness.");
        DATA.put("Ketu_H7",  "Karmic complexity in partnership relationships. A spiritual rather than purely worldly orientation to the significant other. Partnerships may involve significant past-life connection; the dissolution of ordinary romantic expectations in favor of deeper soul-level encounter is a characteristic theme. Relationship serves liberation rather than mere worldly satisfaction.");
